      "writtenOn": "2026-04-01T09:11:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems you\u0027re trying to mimc ANSI C functions time format. Is there particular reason for this, or we can use ISO 8601 instead (\"2026-03-31T11:43:39Z\" instead of \"Tue Mar 31 11:43:39 2026\").\n\nOne of the practical benefit of this would be - easy to order entries by time (especially if one wants to mix entries from different log files) operating with the text without parsing it and converting to a time structure/unixtime.",
      "revId": "9b61f20a6d0f1f4791b33dc410293b09a4b8165c",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
