      "writtenOn": "2026-04-09T01:33:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The ctime format (\"Tue Mar 31 11:43:39 2026\") is fairly common for logs, so I am fine with using that here. We might want to make that format string a (documented) const, or use `%c`, but that may vary on locale settings, but that\u0027s something we can discuss separately.\n\nHowever: ctime assumes `%e` instead of `%d`. Are you OK with that divergence?",
      "parentUuid": "81217b5a_d6590647",
      "revId": "9b61f20a6d0f1f4791b33dc410293b09a4b8165c",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
